OL,3,GNEWSA'My car could appear in Grand
OL,4,ATheft Auto VI'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British gamer said he would be
OL,7,F"jumping with joy" if his American
OL,8,Fpolice car appeared in Grand Theft Auto
OL,9,FVI after developers spent hours
OL,10,Fphotographing and recording it.
OL,12,FLukas Holmes, 28, had dreamed of owning
OL,13,Fa US squad car since he was five and in
OL,14,F2019 imported a 2009 Ford Crown
OL,15,FVictoria from Pennsylvania, to
OL,16,FWarrington, Cheshire.
OL,18,FIn early 2021, he was invited to
OL,19,FMillbrook Proving Ground in
OL,20,FBedfordshire, where a "big client from
OL,21,FEdinburgh" wanted to record the car.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
