OL,4,ATheft Auto VI'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolmes said he had received an email
OL,7,Flater from a member of the audio team
OL,8,Fat Rockstar Games, the Edinburgh-based
OL,9,Fdeveloper behind the Grand Theft Auto
OL,10,Fseries, thanking him for his time.
